                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How big is the Indian diaspora ethnic wear market?</h3>
                                        <p>$8-12B TAM across USA, UK, UAE, Canada, Australia combined. Growing 12-18% annually. Materially under-served by legacy retailers.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I ship from India or build local warehouses?</h3>
                                        <p>Ship from India for MVP + smaller markets. Above ₹5-8 Cr diaspora revenue, consider local depots (USA, UK) to reduce shipping cost + return times.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest sizing mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Only offering Indian sizing labels. Ship dual-labeled sizes + size charts in both systems + generous exchange policy.</p>
                                        <h3>Which diaspora market to prioritise first?</h3>
                                        <p>USA (largest, highest AOV) or UAE (closest, existing operational bridge from India). UK third. Canada + Australia later.</p>
